The <ansi fg="command">reload</ansi> command can be used in the following ways:

<ansi fg="command">reload items</ansi> - Reloads items data files, including any new ones.
<ansi fg="command">reload biomes</ansi> - Reloads biome data files.
<ansi fg="command">reload translations</ansi> - Reloads all translation localize files.
<ansi fg="command">reload mapcache</ansi> - Clears the mapper's per-zone cache so the next <ansi fg="command">map</ansi> command rebuilds from current room data on disk. Use after editing room files (new rooms, new exits, new mapsymbols) without restarting the server.
